territory. Is it the gangs or is it the state?
France 24 English: The focus falls on El&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:18.900
Salvador’s President... Nayib Bukele.
France 24 English: He’s very controversial,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:24.180
very popular in his country, but also criticized&nbsp;
for endangering democracy in El Salvador.
&nbsp;

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:31.320
SIERRA: El Salvador is a small country of just&nbsp;
6.5 million people, and is not usually thought&nbsp;&nbsp;

