gang controlled territory, but that's shifted.&nbsp;
So now, instead of being afraid of the gangs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:04.380
the fear is of repercussions from the&nbsp;
government. He's dismantled the Supreme Court,&nbsp;&nbsp;

