inspiring to think about journalists who want&nbsp;
to report in spite of all of these threats,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:43.980 --> 00:26:49.200
especially because if we're going to go on a local&nbsp;
level, we know that they're not going to be paid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:49.200 --> 00:26:54.600
well. They could be risking their lives, they&nbsp;
could be risking threats and violence against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:54.600 --> 00:27:00.840
their family members. We've seen cases where&nbsp;
