00:27:00.840 --> 00:27:06.180
front of family members. It's really frightening.&nbsp;
How do you create the conditions for people to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:06.180 --> 00:27:11.100
want to become journalists? And the problem is,&nbsp;
this is exactly what weakens the democracy in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:11.100 --> 00:27:14.880
the country because people don't want to. Why&nbsp;
would you do that? Why would you put yourself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:14.880 --> 00:27:20.520
in harm's way? It makes it all the more inspiring&nbsp;
for those who continue to try to report and try&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:20.520 --> 00:27:26.220
to report independently. But it certainly creates&nbsp;
the conditions for, in many parts of the country,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:26.220 --> 00:27:31.440
where journalists face these kinds of threats&nbsp;
from local authorities, from local police,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:31.440 --> 00:27:37.260
from local crime groups, because the threats come&nbsp;
from all different sides that we have a lack of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:37.260 --> 00:27:42.900
information, we have a lack of information&nbsp;
about what's going on. And so it's a real&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:42.900 --> 00:27:47.400
reminder of they're holding a government&nbsp;
accountable that might not be able to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:47.400 --> 00:27:50.640
held accountable in any other way.
HOOTSEN: I'm actually an optimist in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:50.640 --> 00:27:55.140
that sense. If I weren't an optimist I wouldn't be&nbsp;
able to do our job. I think fatalism is fatal in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:55.140 --> 00:28:00.900
advocating for press freedom. People still want a&nbsp;
critical press and every really good journalistic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:00.900 --> 00:28:05.160
investigation immediately gets a huge bump, it&nbsp;
gets a huge response both on social media and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:05.160 --> 00:28:11.280
beyond. And that shows me that ultimately people&nbsp;
will miss it when it's gone. There is a hunger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:11.280 --> 00:28:18.540
for press freedom. There's a hunger for good&nbsp;
journalism and there is good sense amongst the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:18.540 --> 00:28:22.560
general public that press freedom is something&nbsp;
that needs to be protected. And that there are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:22.560 --> 00:28:26.400
still a lot of spaces that are worth defending&nbsp;
and that will continue to be defended.

